801.41;+49402,;35~WP-start~12
Alert = Appears aware of and responsive to the environment on their own.\\
        Follow commands, open eyes spontaneously, and track objects.\\
\\
Voice = Eyes do not open spontaneously but open to verbal stimuli.\\
        Able to respond directly and in a meaningful way.\\
\\
Pain = Only responds to painful stimuli such as pinching the skin or\\
       earlobe.\\
       May move, moan, or cry out directly in response to painful\\
       stimuli.\\
\\
Unresponsive = Does not respond to verbal or painful stimuli.
