headache, fatigue)\\
  *Presence of ANY of       COVID                    Droplet/Contact +\\
   these OR loss of taste                            Eye Protection\\
   or smell\\
\\
Fever + cough +             TB                       Airborne\\
(hemoptysis, night sweats,\\
weight loss)\\
\\
Abscess or draining wound   MRSA, MSSA, GAS          Contact\\
that can't be covered\\
\\
Contact Infection Prevention and Control Specialist if patient placed in 
isolation for confirmation of isolation type.\\
